@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Assertion rewriting now unrolls comprehensions passed to ``all()`` and ``any()``,
+so that the failure report shows the element which did not satisfy the
+predicate instead of an unhelpful ``<generator object ...>`` or list.
